      "text": "The concentration of <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math> is double that of <math> <mrow> <msubsup> <mtext>CO</mtext> <mn>3</mn> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mo>-</mo> </mrow> </msubsup> </mrow> </math>.",
